                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1d3571ab-daaf-3ac2-82b4-0f18673a27df",
                                        "entry_id": "726d92be-aaeb-35ec-b1a4-078eec12642c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A part, portion, or subdivision."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "003e6889-a58d-3d7e-95cb-a266be27a472",
                                        "entry_id": "726d92be-aaeb-35ec-b1a4-078eec12642c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A distinct course of life, action, study, or the like."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cc325b33-90f0-43dd-b7dc-b3122218a6bd",
                                                "sense_id": "003e6889-a58d-3d7e-95cb-a266be27a472",
                                                "text": "Technical things are not his department; he's a people person."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4473d68b-b09d-4dc8-acd9-ff195abd53fe",
                                                "sense_id": "003e6889-a58d-3d7e-95cb-a266be27a472",
                                                "text": "Flair and invention were very much at a premium, suffocated by the relentless pace and often fractious nature of proceedings. The absence of James Morrison from the centre of Scotland’s midfield, the West Brom man ruled out on the morning of the game by illness, had already diminished the creative capacity of the home side in that department."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5a8bdf69-e466-4f2a-9e37-c1bc73520c8a",
                                                "sense_id": "003e6889-a58d-3d7e-95cb-a266be27a472",
                                                "text": "superior to Pope in Pope's own peculiar department of literature"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4ffedcec-2ed4-313c-af89-9eea62d6e77c",
                                        "entry_id": "726d92be-aaeb-35ec-b1a4-078eec12642c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A specified aspect or quality."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ae403d3-4ec7-41f6-a9b2-b7b0b09b40ca",
                                                "sense_id": "4ffedcec-2ed4-313c-af89-9eea62d6e77c",
                                                "text": "The 2012 Boston Marathon was outstanding in the temperature department; runners endured temperatures of no less than 88 degrees Fahrenheit."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "89b10538-dec6-415e-acfb-2a18862e78af",
                                                "sense_id": "4ffedcec-2ed4-313c-af89-9eea62d6e77c",
                                                "text": "While the Chiefs superstar trails legendary quarterback Tom Brady in the Super Bowl wins department – the former Patriot and Tampa Bay Buccaneer has seven to Mahomes’ three – the chatter will only get louder and louder as to whether or not the 2023 Super Bowl MVP is the greatest of all time or not as he continues his career."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0a6b4a70-7bc4-32cc-8c3c-9b0e06146bb3",
                                        "entry_id": "726d92be-aaeb-35ec-b1a4-078eec12642c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A subdivision of an organization.",
                                            "One of the principal divisions of executive government"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f66d2829-f0f3-4b8f-aaea-7c16206a6774",
                                                "sense_id": "0a6b4a70-7bc4-32cc-8c3c-9b0e06146bb3",
                                                "text": "the Treasury Department; the Department of Agriculture; police department"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "08f4e1d1-3505-304d-9431-5ac1ca8a8540",
                                        "entry_id": "726d92be-aaeb-35ec-b1a4-078eec12642c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A subdivision of an organization.",
                                            "One of the divisions of instructions"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "in a university"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "23db4992-b531-41f6-8f75-0489982ee2c2",
                                                "sense_id": "08f4e1d1-3505-304d-9431-5ac1ca8a8540",
                                                "text": "the physics department; the history department; the math department"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5349a5a6-1f15-3fb2-be99-48aee93d8c6d",
                                        "entry_id": "726d92be-aaeb-35ec-b1a4-078eec12642c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A territorial division; a district; especially, in France, one of the districts into which the country is divided for governmental purposes, similar to a county in the UK and in the USA. France is composed of 101 départements organized in 18 régions, each department is divided into arrondissements, in turn divided into cantons."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2b3c1a64-650a-4ffd-8086-1c16a186e95c",
                                                "sense_id": "5349a5a6-1f15-3fb2-be99-48aee93d8c6d",
                                                "text": "The departments were the bricks from which the edifice of the nation was to be constructed."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aaec19ca-c05a-382d-8efa-313638189816",
                                        "entry_id": "726d92be-aaeb-35ec-b1a4-078eec12642c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A military subdivision of a country"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "historical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7abbeed4-03d3-4314-b0a5-cca46f16e9a5",
                                                "sense_id": "aaec19ca-c05a-382d-8efa-313638189816",
                                                "text": "the Department of the Potomac"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "33f76709-ba29-3b28-97ec-90cc75cf0981",
                                        "entry_id": "726d92be-aaeb-35ec-b1a4-078eec12642c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Act of departing; departure."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4d97a7af-0216-4ad6-baae-661c27f83667",
                                                "sense_id": "33f76709-ba29-3b28-97ec-90cc75cf0981",
                                                "text": "For though Contraria iuxta ſe poſita magis illuceſcunt [opposites placed next to each other shine more brightly] (by an olde Rule) yet it hath beene ſubtilly, and indeede truely noted that our Sight, is not vvell contented, vvith thoſe ſudden departments, from one extreame to another; Therefore let them haue, rather a Duskiſh Tincture, then an abſolute blacke."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0b708ce2-d30e-4bfa-95fd-685c940052e8",
                        "source_entry_id": "8dc49c77-04db-3e7e-b0cf-63cf532527d9",
                        "source_sense_id": "fa174393-d96e-3b06-8cb4-60e5e42dca08",
                        "source_sense_description": "offizielle Bezeichnung der höchsten Verwaltungsbehörden in den Vereinigten Staaten von Amerika",
                        "target_lang_word": "département",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "département",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ceede256-8fe5-3c04-a8b6-e11ee1526049",
                                        "entry_id": "535f3585-9e8d-3a9b-ba84-b95d544b86fb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Chacune des parties des affaires d’État, distribuées entre les ministres et dont la connaissance leur est attribuée."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "553c8682-04d5-4fc4-b442-ff7df1cb59e9",
                                                "sense_id": "ceede256-8fe5-3c04-a8b6-e11ee1526049",
                                                "text": "A l’est de l’afrag s’étendait une sorte d’esplanade, le mechouar, bordé de tentes faisant office de benikas ou bureaux où les vizirs et leurs secrétaires venaient expédier les affaires de leur département."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9381f668-8a24-427e-a2f3-e824f02400a7",
                                                "sense_id": "ceede256-8fe5-3c04-a8b6-e11ee1526049",
                                                "text": "Le département de la Guerre."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "33e62033-16ee-4fee-9d71-93da6dd62d77",
                                                "sense_id": "ceede256-8fe5-3c04-a8b6-e11ee1526049",
                                                "text": "Le département des affaires étrangères."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "38112ef5-9d10-341f-aaf5-d96ee056cdba",
                                        "entry_id": "535f3585-9e8d-3a9b-ba84-b95d544b86fb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Principale division administrative du territoire français. La France compte cent départements dont quatre départements d’outre-mer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Administration territoriale"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6f52372f-4105-4c8d-b079-25951d3c70e9",
                                                "sense_id": "38112ef5-9d10-341f-aaf5-d96ee056cdba",
                                                "text": "A la frontière de quatre départements (Haute-Saône, Territoire de Belfort, Vosges, Haut-Rhin), le ballon d’Alsace constitue également l’un des plus beaux points de vue de la région (sommet à 1 247 m)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "346136ab-460c-4257-bc4e-b1ef02e1f4fd",
                                                "sense_id": "38112ef5-9d10-341f-aaf5-d96ee056cdba",
                                                "text": "Le 22 décembre 1789, la France fut divisée en quatre-vingt-trois départements à peu près égaux en étendue et en population."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "72ce4939-3add-4ad8-a93a-784379aaa5fd",
                                                "sense_id": "38112ef5-9d10-341f-aaf5-d96ee056cdba",
                                                "text": "Vous, dont la vie a été la poésie la plus inutile de ce siècle, puisque votre sang répandu sur l’Europe, et vos énormes souffrances exigées par un colosse, n’ont pas empêché la France de perdre dix départements acquis par la République, comment donnez-vous dans ce raisonnement."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "075f9574-0957-413e-a83f-e1caeff912b4",
                                                "sense_id": "38112ef5-9d10-341f-aaf5-d96ee056cdba",
                                                "text": "« J’ai vu quatre-vingt-six départements l’un à côté de l’autre, messieurs, rangés sagement l’un à côté de l’autre d’une façon dont vous n’avez pas idée.\n« Quatre-vingt-six départements qui ont des dents !\n« Quatre-vingt-six départements qui ont des pointes, des épines, des crêtes, des lames, des tenons, des crochets, des griffes, des ongles, et qui ont aussi des fentes, des fissures, des crevasses, des creux, des trous ; et qui s’engrènent, qui s’ajustent, qui s’emboîtent, et qui s’accouplent comme une bande de cochons.\n« Chose étrange, au milieu de chaque département il y a un œil ! »"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9d533fd4-f0b9-4f42-acea-536fe5ffeb42",
                                                "sense_id": "38112ef5-9d10-341f-aaf5-d96ee056cdba",
                                                "text": "Je sors d’un département, l’Orne, qui est celui où l’on trouva le plus de réfractaires sous le premier Empire."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dd621beb-c7ba-4482-9fa3-d75b883ae2d2",
                                                "sense_id": "38112ef5-9d10-341f-aaf5-d96ee056cdba",
                                                "text": "Il possédait si bien la carte des fossiles du département qu’il ne donnait jamais un coup de piochon sans exhumer un spécimen rare."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c05e99f6-ba7f-3a6a-a0a3-db04d6b632dc",
                                        "entry_id": "535f3585-9e8d-3a9b-ba84-b95d544b86fb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "L’administration qui dirige ce territoire."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e8d12922-463a-415d-9436-c5342ba5c941",
                                                "sense_id": "c05e99f6-ba7f-3a6a-a0a3-db04d6b632dc",
                                                "text": "Le département fait de louables efforts pour créer un dispensaire antituberculeux. Il organise l’inspection des écoles. Quant à un sanatorium, n’en parlons pas pour l’instant."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a652abac-4c65-39b7-b3e3-6f1a7b7662c6",
                                        "entry_id": "535f3585-9e8d-3a9b-ba84-b95d544b86fb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "L’ensemble des habitants de ce territoire."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6cf7ec08-bc1a-4b92-8bef-68e5a84e2b0a",
                                                "sense_id": "a652abac-4c65-39b7-b3e3-6f1a7b7662c6",
                                                "text": "Tout le monde étant d’accord pour me désigner nettement sous le nom de scepticisme, d’impiété ou de laïcisme l’esprit dominant du département, tout le monde aussi, on l’a vu, reconnaît son esprit de progrès …."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ef58818a-46a6-308f-b31c-ff4f977f5181",
